Package: poistree
Type: Package
Title: Bayesian Poisson Point Process Tree Models
Version: 0.2.2
Date: 2026-10-01
Authors@R: person(
    given = "Pulong",
    family = "Ma",
    role = c("aut", "cre"),
    email = "plma@iastate.edu",
    comment = c("Personal email" = "mpulong@gmail.com")
    )
Maintainer: Pulong Ma <plma@iastate.edu>
Description: Bayesian Poisson process trees for intensity estimation on high-dimensional covariate space. The extensible unified interface
    separates the gating mechanism, intensity structure, scale prior, and
    posterior sampler. Implemented models include hard and soft terminal-leaf
    Poisson process trees and hard and soft Poisson process trees.
    Available algorithms include sequential Monte Carlo, reversible-jump
    Markov chain Monte Carlo, and informed reversible-jump Markov chain Monte
    Carlo.
